{
  "$schema": "https://turborepo.dev/schema.json",
  "ui": "tui",
  "tasks": {
    "build": {
      "dependsOn": ["^build"],
      "inputs": ["$TURBO_DEFAULT$", ".env*"],
      "outputs": [".next/**", "!.next/cache/**", "dist/**"]
    },
    "lint": {
      "dependsOn": ["^lint"]
    },
    "typecheck": {
      "dependsOn": ["^typecheck"]
    },
    "test": {
      "cache": false,
      // Turbo filters the environment: a variable a task does not declare
      // never reaches it, even when the CI job sets it and the step logs
      // show it. Eleven test files read DEV_DB_URL to assert against a real
      // Postgres, and without this line they see it unset and throw at
      // module load — which is exactly how the Test gate spent its life
      // verifying none of the schema it exists to protect.
      //
      // Eleven, not seven: the activity-feed branch added four —
      // `bounded-contexts/activity/__tests__/activity.repository.test.ts`,
      // `bounded-contexts/activity/__tests__/provider-name-reader.adapter.test.ts`,
      // `bounded-contexts/activity/__tests__/service-name-reader.adapter.test.ts`,
      // and `shared/infrastructure/database/__tests__/activity-constraints.test.ts`
      // (converted from asserting Drizzle object properties to asserting the
      // real table, in the same review that corrected this count). The count
      // is not decoration — follow-up #53 is the argument for moving all of
      // them off a shared remote Neon, and it is only as convincing as the
      // number in front of it. `grep -rl DEV_DB_URL packages/backend/src`
      // (filtered to `*.test.ts` — that grep also matches the two
      // `drizzle.config.ts` files, which are not tests and are not counted
      // here).
      //
      // The `e2e` task below needed the same treatment for E2E_DB_URL, and
      // ci.yml's comment on that job already spelled the trap out. It cost
      // a CI round to rediscover it here.
      "passThroughEnv": ["DEV_DB_URL"]
    },
    "e2e": {
      "cache": false,
      "persistent": false,
      "passThroughEnv": ["E2E_DB_URL", "E2E_API_URL", "E2E_WEB_URL", "NTIZO_E2E_NODE_BIN"]
    },
    "dev": {
      "cache": false,
      "persistent": true
    },
    "deploy:dev": {
      "dependsOn": ["^build"],
      "cache": false
    }
  }
}
